window.products.push({"id":881165,"name":"Silicone Dough Scraper with Stainless Steel Sheet, Curved Edge Flexible Bowl Scraper for Baking, Food Grade Silicone Bench Scraper for Sourdough Bread","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411yM9ZDHHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Silicone Cover & Stainless Steel Core : Inside the pastry scraper is sturdy stainless steel sheet, compared with other flimsy plastic scraper, our baking scraper won't get bent, worn out or cracked. It is more durable and has longer service life. The covering surface is made of food-grade silicone, which has great flexibility and heat resistance. Unlike metal dough cutter, which are too stiff and sharp, silicone scraper can avoid leaving scratches on your kitchenware or hurting your hands. Practical Design : Sapid silicone bowl scraper is equipped with both curved and straight edge, meets different functional requirements at the same time. The curved edge is flexible and soft enough to conform to different sizes and shapes of bread bowls. You can use the wider arc in larger bowls and the narrower corner for smaller bowls, which does a superior job of scraping every bit of dough from the bowl. Meanwhile, the flat edge making it ideal for cutting dough into pieces. Perfect Size : 5.98\"×4.3\", a comfortable size to grip, and a suitably larger size, making it much easier for you to stir, cut and get dough out of bowls. 2 Pieces included, meet your needs of use and replacement. Multipurpose Kitchen Scraper : Not only can use for bread dough, fondant, pizza, cream, cake, cheese, batter, chocolate, honey, etc, for all your homemade baking needs, but also good for cleaning sticky grease or other residue on your pan, plate, griddle, board, table and counter top. Super handy for clearing kitchen messes, it is an indispensable multifunctional kitchen scraper tool. Easy to Clean & Store : With nonstick silicone surface, any residue on the dough scrapper is easy to rinse off. Also our bread scraper is dishwasher safe. There is a small hanging hole designed, it's quite convenient for storage and space saving.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411yM9ZDHHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAPID","source_asin":"B0BY4W6KDD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-881165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY4W6KDD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY4W6KDD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
