window.products.push({"id":881244,"name":"Karelian Heritage Polished Shungite Tile 5.90x3.94 inches (15x10 cm) | Big Decorative Mineral Shungite Stone Tile | Shungite for Cell Phone | Shungite","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nJxt6ZtkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AUTHENTIC Our shungite sticker plates are made of real stone extracted from the Zazhoginsky deposit in Karelia. This is the only deposit in the world where such an amazing mineral is mined. We are originally from Karelia and have been specializing in Shungite since 2015. EMF & 5G PROTECTION If you’ve been searching for a blocker or a harmonizer to reduce the electromagnetic field in your space, you might have discovered authentic Shungite stones. The shungite tile is an unique item that will protect you from radiation emitted by devices such as laptops, phones and Wi-Fi routers. ENHANCE POSITIVE ENERGY Shungite is a powerful healing stone and natural stress reliever, popularized by its ability to dispel negative energies. Carry it in your pocket or place it on your altar to bring happiness, positivity, and joy into your life. Uses: healing crystals and healing stones, chakra meditation pyramid, grounding pyramid, manifesting crystals, harmonizer. SPACE HARMONIZATION Shungite has an ability to cleanse bad energy from your home, personal space, or office. The radius of action of the shungite tile is 1.5 times greater than quartz, lapis lazuli and jade. Placing it up at the highest point of your room will help shift a vibe in your home or office from negative or stressful to a more peaceful one. It is considered to be more powerful than an orgone figurine or an onyx crystal. THIS SHUNGITE SET 1 piece, 5.90x3.94 inches (150x100 mm) Polished Shungite Tile. It will arrive in original packaging with a business card. Black residue from unpolished Shungite is normal and safe, and is a sign of authenticity. Crafted from durable genuine Type III Shungite. Order yours now from Karelian Heritage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nJxt6ZtkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Karelian Heritage","source_asin":"B07FGG8SX7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-881244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FGG8SX7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FGG8SX7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":881245,"name":"Premium Compartments Cube Storage Shelf 6 Cubes Light Weight and Adjustable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810KwyDRmYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Solution To Overcrowded Closets My wife was the real brains behind this cube storage shelf.You see, our closet was a mess. Actually, a terrible mess.I mean we had winter clothes mixed with summer clothes mixed with going out clothes mixed with stay at home on Friday night and watch 10 minutes of a movie then fall asleep on the sofa clothes.I for one could never find any specific shirt I was looking for. But I could live with that.My wife had it worse. She often complained of having nothing to wear at all.Can you imagine? A closet full of clothes with nothing to wear...Obviously she couldn't live with that.So we dove deep into product development mode. And after months of work, and months of me wearing shirts which didn't quite go, we're so happy with our new Cube Storage Shelf.We love it, and we think you will too. Here's why - Quality Construction: It's made to the highest quality standards using the highest quality materials. Light Weight: Makes it very easy to move from room to room depending on where you need it. Modular: Lets you put it together in the best configuration to suit your situation. And it comes with 12 feet so you can have two, standalone, 3 cube units if you like. Declutters Bedroom Closets: Ideal for items like clothes and clothing accessories, bed linen, towels, shoes etc. Organizes Living Room Spaces: Also a great organizer for other home or office areas. Great for items like small books, toys, dvds, notepads and more. It's backed by our manufacturer 30 day money back guarantee with 1 year free replacement warranty.Simply click the Buy Now button to get yours today. PS: In case you were wondering, my wife and I finally have our clothes situation sorted. And we'd love to hear if you do too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810KwyDRmYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Premium Compartments","source_asin":"B07TY8KBF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-881245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TY8KBF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TY8KBF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":881246,"name":"Dress My Cupcake Standard Cupcake Wrappers, Chevron, Sky Blue, Set of 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415BIhKfx4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Dress My Cupcake is the world's largest manufacturer of dessert table supplies and couture party decor. Our best selling product line includes designer cupcake wrappers, tissue paper pom poms, cupcake stands, cakepop supplies, crystals, vintage straws, washi tape, glitter ribbon, dessert sticks, DIY wooden cutlery kits and so much more. Dress My Cupcake offers designer cupcake wrappers in over 500 colors and styles, that provide an elegant look to your cupcakes by hiding wrinkly cupcake liners. Dress My Cupcake products have been used to create festive candy buffets and dessert tables at all types of special events, including weddings, bridal showers, baby showers, birthdays, college events, bar and bat mitzvahs, corporate events, Hollywood galas and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415BIhKfx4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dress My Cupcake","source_asin":"B00ERV6FV6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-881246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ERV6FV6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ERV6FV6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
