window.products.push({"id":881340,"name":"nambe Bella Picture Frame, 5\" x 7\" | Photo Frame with Tempered Glass | Vintage and Contemporary Design | Tabletop Display Family, Friends, Wedding Gif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":63.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cPPd3DBCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CAPTURE A MOMENT FOREVER: Frame your favorite people and places in fabulous style. The Bella frame is perfect for preserving a precious moment forever. From images of family, vacations, to the beauties of everyday life, this frame is an excellent way to accentuate what you already love and display it for all others to see. SLEEK SOPHISTICATION: The artfully crafted curves of the Bella Frame bring an air of refined modernism to any surface, while its sleek bends draw the gaze inward to the photo, where it belongs. The simple and chic design pairs perfectly with any existing home décor theme, while bringing an extra splash of sophistication. STEVE COZZOLINO CREATION: Based in New York City, the focus of Cozzolino Studio is the fusion of art and science-the synergy of form and function, poetry and technology, appearance and performance. To coalesce beauty with technology, to achieve a sensibility and innovation that is empathetic to the consumer and, above all, elevates our lives daily. MUSEUM QUALITY DESIGN: Recognized for its award-winning designs for more than 60 years, Nambe’s commitment to timeless beauty, artistic integrity and uncompromising quality is evident in the brand’s collection of serve ware, barware, home décor and gift items. Nambe collaborates with the world’s most esteemed designers to develop products that bring function and style into the home. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: Package contains (1) Nambe Bella Picture Frame, 5\" x 7\". Modern décor style. Made of chrome plate and glass. Holds a single photo, accommodating both vertical and horizontal positioning. To clean, wipe with damp cloth and dry immediately. Designed by Steve Cozzolino in 2013 for the Bella collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cPPd3DBCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B00EO8DHHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-881340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EO8DHHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EO8DHHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
