window.products.push({"id":881486,"name":"NOVICA Large Brown Romantic Wood Sculpture, 12.25\" Tall 'Don't Let Go'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VlflHT6fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: Strengthened by the power of their love, a couple cuddles in the comfort of each other's arms. Though anonymous and faceless, the sculpture gains expressive intensity through Made Mustika's original design. The statuette epitomizes intimacy, and the effect is enhanced by the natural grain of suar wood. - Signed by the artist - Each artwork is unique -- wood grain, color, and pattern will differ slightly from picture About our Artist: The father of a son and two daughters, Wayan Mustika is a wood carver from the Gianyar regency. He is also a teacher at a school near his village. After school, he takes a brief rest before beginning work on his art. Mustika began by carving traditional themes, such lord Wisnu riding on the Garuda bird. Then Mustika learned to carve traditional Balinese items on buildings. A few years later, his interest moved to modern and abstract sculptures, which he continues to create at present.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VlflHT6fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B0009G0VL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-881486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009G0VL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009G0VL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
