window.products.push({"id":881607,"name":"Ekena Millwork NCH21X33WA Small Waltz Wall Niche, Factory Primed-Ready for Paint","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":130.02,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZzWYrM-GL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description Niches have been used in homes for almost 2000 years, first made of white marble in Nero's home. Most niches are still white and were mostly made of plaster for many years. Now that many modern architectural products are made of urethane, custom millwork and details such as recessed niches have become affordable for any home improvement project. Niches are distinctive architectural accents. Often used to display sculptures, vases, clocks, plants, and flowers, niches are beautiful and functional details that add value to any home interior. They are often used in main hallways, dining rooms, foyers, and staircases. An important aspect of a niche is its ability to concentrate or disperse light, so its placement should be based on the availability of light, either sunlight or interior lighting fixtures. Ceiling accent lights are often added as a compliment above a niche. Niches made of urethane can be easy to install for anyone, simply cut a hole in the drywall and place the niche inside. These niches will also require little maintenance in the future, and offer beauty and value to your home for decades to come. Ekena Millwork offers niches in varying heights, widths, and depths to fit the scale of your home. From the Manufacturer Our wall niches are the perfect accent pieces for your wall. Each pattern is carefully crafted after traditional and historical designs. It comes to you factory primed and ready for your paint, faux finish, gel stain, marbleizing and more. Another benefit of polyurethane is it will not rot or crack, and is impervious to insect manifestations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZzWYrM-GL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ekena Millwork","source_asin":"B004587XRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-881607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004587XRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004587XRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
