window.products.push({"id":881613,"name":"100% Microfiber Golden Leaves Print Oversized Beach Towel 75\"x34\", Fast-Drying, Sand Free Towel for Travel, Pool, Camping","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gCXdFK9EL._AC_.jpg","description":"🏖️Fast-drying & Sand Free: With our beach towel which is sand proof and quick-drying, you don’t need to shake your towel constantly when you have a good time at the beach. It’s also much easier to clean up the sand from your body so you won’t get it everywhere 🏖️Compact & Light: The oversized beach towel we offer is 75’’ x 34’’, which is larger than a normal towel, so it can cover your whole body. But don’t worry, it’s still lightweight. You can fold it up to almost nothing. The travel towel is perfect for you to carry in a small bag or just put in your pocket 🏖️Durable & No-fading: The travel towel is made of 100% microfiber to enhance durability that is to say you can use it for at least a few years. Plus, these graphic prints with vibrant colors will not fade even after multiple washes. It is the perfect towel that suitable for the entire family, regardless of age 🏖️Eye-catching Design: Here you can find distinctive all-over print beach towels with a variety of patterns which are designed by independent artists from all over the world. No matter what style you’re looking for, there’s bound to be one available. On each side printed with two different patterns, with the pop, excellent design, you can also use it to decorate your home when you don’t use it 🏖️Eco-friendly: It is a great alternative for people who want to go green. We have adopted a new water-saving and environmentally friendly printing technology--sublimation printing which is simple, no washing, no drying that can avoid dyestuff pollution of water and other issues, in line with the Green, environmental protection, sustainable development trend","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gCXdFK9EL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VANSILK","source_asin":"B09TSQRLQB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-881613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TSQRLQB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TSQRLQB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
