window.products.push({"id":881698,"name":"Madison Park Solandis Rug, 21x24 Contour, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tXljFNX4S._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Update your bathroom with the classic style Madison Park Solandis Contour Cotton Tufted Rug. This 100% cotton tufted contour rug features embroidered butterfly details and a floral motif in beautiful blue and white hues, for a charming look. The skid resistant backing prevents the rug from slipping on your floor. Incredibly soft, this cotton tufted bath rug is machine washable to make cleaning a breeze. Coordinating shower curtain and towels available and sold separately, for a complete look!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tXljFNX4S._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Madison Park","source_asin":"B0793QZBYJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-881698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0793QZBYJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0793QZBYJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":881699,"name":"ZEAL'N LIFE 10-in-1 Steam Mop - All-In-One Floor Steamer w/Handheld Function, Convenient Hardwood Floor Cleaner & Tile Floor Steam Cleaner, Multipurpo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617u22vFlBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALL IN ONE: ZEAL'N LIFE provides a complete, inexpensive range of steam mops for floor cleaning. With premium features, the package includes a handle, host, water tank, mop cloths, flat & round brushes, elbow nozzle, desktop brush, scraper, and connector. One can use it as a mop for hardwood floor cleaning or as a furniture and laminate floor mop. It can also be used as a tile and grout steam cleaner, countertop cleaner, or carpet steam cleaners for home use. CONVENIENT HANDHELD FEATURE: The handheld steam cleaner function is your all-around cleaning buddy around the house. Just detach the mop tube, attach the connector, and use your desired brush. It is also useful for cleaning delicate items such as glass or porcelain without damaging their surface. DEEP CLEANING STEAMER FLOOR MOP: Our high power steamer contains 1500W that allows high-temperature steam within 20 seconds. This steam cleaner for floors makes it easy to remove stubborn, sticky stains that have been left by regular mops for tile floor cleaning, giving you an excellent, brighter, and cleaner surface floor. HIGHLY RELIABLE: The steam floor cleaner utilizes 250 degrees Fahrenheit (121 degrees Celsius) of hot steam that quickly removes stains and sticky messes from carpets, upholstery, and other fabrics. It is recommended for households with pets or babies because of its cleaning power and ability to evaporate after use. It can also be used as a steam mop for laminate floors. 3 STEAM MODES: Our steam mops have 3 steam modes: light for quick cleanups, normal for everyday use, and deep for tough stains and messes. This steam cleaner for grout and tile is suitable for various housework, including garments, carpets and upholstery, windows, and more. It's a wonderful addition to any home or office. EFFICIENT STEAM CLEANER: Find a great solution for all types of cleaning with our steam mop for hardwood floors. This steamer mop is excellent for making your home look cleaner, fresher, and more hygienic. LIGHTWEIGHT DESIGN: With a weight of only 2.2 lbs without water, this floor cleaner for mopping includes 2 highly absorbent washable pads that are specially designed to fit the mop perfectly. No need for messy mops, heavy buckets, and pads falling off, our steam mop cleaner has a high steam feature that will remove dirt and grime from your floors in a breeze. EASY TO INSTALL AND OPERATE: The tile grout steam cleaner is easy to assemble and operate without the worry of complicated assembly processes or confusing instructions. Our 10-in-1 cleaning steam mop comes complete with the easy-to-follow guide to make sure that it can be used with ease. WORKS FOR ALL SEALED HARD FLOORS: Our product is an amazing steam mop for tile floors with grout, hardwood floors, marble, and stone. It is also suitable for use around the kitchen because of its ability to remove oil stains easily with the flexible hose pipe. 10-IN-1: Clean virtually anything with our steamer mop for all floors. With its attachments and variety of brushes, you can steam floors, carpets, windows, glass doors, and more with just this one amazing floor steam cleaner!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617u22vFlBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZEAL'N LIFE","source_asin":"B09XX9R68C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-881699","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XX9R68C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XX9R68C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
