window.products.push({"id":881716,"name":"HALOYIVGO 8 Inch Chef Knife, Hand Forged Professional Chef's Knife with Pakkawood Handle, AUS-8 High Carbon Stainless Steel, Kitchen Meat Vegetable Kn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XTaZ4y0XL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"8 Inches Chef Knife; chef's knife is an all-rounder when it comes to knives and is designed for a variety of kitchen tasks. It will excel at chopping vegetables and slicing larger cuts of meat, whilst the narrow tip enables very precise work. chef knife is a true workhorse that will make for tireless work during long hours of food prep in a professional kitchen. Ultra-sharp;chef’s knife is equipped with an 8-inch blade that is made from AUS-8 high-carbon stainless steel. This provides extreme durability and strength. chef’s knife’s blade rates a 60 on the Rockwell Hardness Scale. The blade on our chef’s knife is designed to be at a 15 degree angle.This provides our knife with excellent edge retention, the ability to stay sharper longer, and protection against chipping. BLADE FINISH;The chef knife bears visible impressions of the hand-forging process (round hammer dents on the blade), which gives it a beautiful finish and also prevents food from sticking to the blade. This blade finish is also called tsuchime. Air bubbles form in the dimples and help prevent food from sticking to the blade. Because there is less surface that is in contact with food, there is also less friction and, consequently, less force is needed for cutting. HANDLE: Pakkawood handle is contoured for comfort and control, , and features a stainless bolster. The knife tang ends halfway through the handle, further reducing the weight of the knife and pushing the balance more towards the tip of the blade, like with wastyle, traditional chef knife handles. The handle will fit well in your hands for both the hammer and pinch grip. Whether you enjoy cooking in your kitchen, by the campfire, or next to your barbeque grill, this chef’s knife will provide you with almost anything that you need. With the extra durability provided by the high-carbon stainless steel construction,. And with the moisture- and heat-resistant handle, it will stand up to the elements no matter the weather.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XTaZ4y0XL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HALOYIVGO","source_asin":"B0BYV36NKQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-881716","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYV36NKQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYV36NKQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
